OL,3,GNEWSAQuake villager thought 'ironing
OL,4,Aboard had fallen over'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTell us which stories we should cover
OL,7,Fin Lancashire
OL,9,FA small Lancashire village has
OL,10,Fexperienced its fourth earthquake
OL,11,Fwithin six months.
OL,13,FThe British Geological Survey (BGS)
OL,14,Fsaid the 2.7 magnitude tremor was felt
OL,15,Fin Silverdale, Lancaster, at 09:38 BST.
OL,17,FSarah, who lives in the village, said
OL,18,Fshe thought her "ironing board had
OL,19,Ffallen over in the airing cupboard"
OL,20,Fwhen she felt the vibrations.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
